{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["For a list of fish and their locations, see ",["l","鱼","Fish"],"."]],["p",["For information about the Fishing Skill and Mechanics, see ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing"],"."]],["p",["For an index to the completed fish collection, see ",["l","收集品","Collections"],"."]],["p",["See also: ",["l","渔具","Tackle"],", ",["l","鱼饵","Bait"]]],["p",["This page provides fishing strategy information for ",["l","Stardew Valley","Stardew Valley"],"."]]]],["Basics of Strategy",2,[["p",["The availability of many types of fish can depend on various factors: the location of the fishing spot, the season, the time of day, and the weather. Match the fishing location to current conditions as necessary to get a chance to catch certain type(s) of fish."]]]],["Locations",3,[["p",["Fishing spots are commonly broken up into ocean, lake, and river types. However, while most fishing spots in a similar body of water will share catches, the map also plays a role. For instance, the river in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," is not the same as the river in ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],". Ponds usually have a smaller selection of fish, if any, compared to larger bodies of water and the selection is usually specific to the map where the pond is found. Note that generally, the less fish there are in a certain location, the more likely it is that ",["l","垃圾","trash"]," will be caught."]],["p",["The Sewers"]],["p",[["l","下水道","The Sewers"]," are an easy and productive fishing location, especially to level up the fishing skill or farm treasure. ",["l","鲤鱼","Carp"]," is the least difficult fish to catch in the game and it is the only fish in the sewers (except for a ",["l","变种鲤鱼","legendary fish"],"). Therefore, almost every cast of the line results in either an immediate item reward or a quick Carp catch."]]]],["Bobber Position",3,[["p",["In general, it is optimal to cast the bobber ",["l","钓鱼","as far from land as possible"],". Longer casting distances are important, but also casting east/west instead of north/south can increase the distance, as can fishing in wide-open water. In addition to affecting the quality of the fish, distance from land also affects the chances of catching certain fish over other ones. While all non-legendary fish can be caught 1 tile from land, a lot of the more difficult and profitable fish have a higher chance to be caught further from land."]],["p",[["l","钓鱼","Bubbles"]," greatly increase the rate at which fish bite and can also alter the relative chances of each fish type at the location. Careful placement of the bobber on the edge of the bubbles allows the bubble bonus to be used in any of the adjacent tiles, providing some ability to increase the distance from land."]]]],["Fishing Skill",3,[["p",["Fishing level is important because each increase in the fishing level increases the fishing bar size by 8 pixels. The longer the fishing bar is, the easier it is to catch fish. The fishing bar will continue to increase by this amount even as the player goes beyond level 10 (with ",["l","效果","buffs"],"). This means the bar can get much bigger than it naturally would be even at fishing level 10. Using a fishing rod with the ",["l","锻造","Master enchant"]," will also increase the fishing bar size by 8 pixels. Each ",["l","软木塞浮标","Cork Bobber"]," used will increase the fishing bar size by 24 pixels. Using ",["l","高级鱼饵","Deluxe Bait"]," increases the fishing bar size by 12 pixels."]]]],["Catching Difficult Fish",3,[["p",["This concept of the fishing bar getting bigger is especially useful when trying to catch extremely hard fish such as the ",["l","鱼","Legendary Fish"]," and the ",["l","章鱼","Octopus"],". Reaching Fishing level 10, using an iridium rod with a ",["l","软木塞浮标","Cork Bobber"]," and with the Master enchant, and eating food (better prepared with ",["l","齐氏调味料","Qi Seasoning"],") that provides a temporary fishing ",["l","效果","buff"]," (e.g., ",["l","海泡布丁","Seafoam Pudding"],") will all help make catching these difficult fish much more manageable."]],["p",["The ",["l","陷阱浮标","Trap Bobber"]," is also a great combination with a large fishing bar, as it significantly reduces the speed at which difficult fish escape. The ",["l","祝福雕像","Blessing Of Waters"]," can also be used to make catching the fish easier, as it decreases the difficulty of legendary fish by 25% and non-legendary fish (except ",["l","鲤鱼","Carp"],") by 50% and causes the progress bar to decrease 50% slower when the fish isn't being reeled in."]]]],["Fishing Zones",2,[["p",["The following images show the ",["l","钓鱼","distances from land"]," based on the location where the bobber lands, color coded as:\n",["f","DistanceKey.png",80]]],["p",["Note that these maps are not valid on iOS and Android because of a ",["l","钓鱼","bug"],"."]]]],["The Farm",3,[["p",["Standard Farm\nRiverland Farm"]],["g",[[null,0,[],"StandardFarmDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"RiverlandFarmDistances.png"]]],["p",["Forest Farm\nHill-top Farm"]],["g",[[null,0,[],"ForestFarmDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"Hill-topFarmDistances.png"]]],["p",["Wilderness Farm\nFour Corners Farm"]],["g",[[null,0,[],"WildernessFarmDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"4CornersFarmDistances.png"]]],["p",["Beach Farm\nMeadowlands Farm"]],["g",[[null,0,[],"BeachFarmDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"Farm_RanchingDistances.png"]]]]],["Cindersap Forest",3,[["g",[[null,0,[],"TownDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"ForestDistances.png"]]]]],["The Mountain",3,[["g",[[null,0,[],"BeachDistances.png"]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"MountainDistances.png"]]]]],["The Sewers",3,[["g",[[null,0,[],"DesertDistances.png"]]],["g",[["SewerDistances.png",320,[]]]]]],["Secret Woods",3,[["g",[["MinesDistances.png",320,["Mine floors 20, 60, & 100"]]]],["g",[["SecretWoodsDistances.png",320,[]]]]]],["Mutant Bug Lair",3,[["g",[["SubmarineDistances.png",320,["The submarine ride at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]]]]],["g",[[null,0,[],"MutantBugLairDistances.png"]]]]],["Island South",3,[["g",[["SwampDistances.png",3